Z||000013||Tina||01-06-2001||01:20 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by jerpro:<BR><B>?!?!?!??! You are lucky it did't blow earlier.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Your propably right,I could of went earlier.<BR>Didn't though,even with the constant daily abuse,it held up to it. Not bad for a 16 year old tranny.<BR>But in order to find out what your limit is, you gotta take it there.<BR>It took a 1/2 hour of constant burnouts on a private street. Flat-bed waiting to bring it back to the shop.<BR>We knew all along it would go sooner or later The question was though " what would it take to do it"  <P>Tina  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> <BR>||||reg||1
